{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802520/extras/logo.png?t=1749615869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the \u201c<strong>Old Dog</strong>\u201d mode against Bot players and get a taste of the horror-card game style; bluff, swap, and outsmart to avoid the dreaded Dog Card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802520/extras/Screenshot_2025-06-03_225257.png?t=1749615869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802520/extras/dogStaring.gif?t=1749615869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stay off the dog\u2019s radar!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your only concern is to avoid ending up on the dog's menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802520/extras/oldDoggg.png?t=1749615869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802520/extras/oldDog.gif?t=1749615869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>How to Play:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>Initial Discard:</strong> After all cards are dealt, each player discards any matching pairs in hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>Turn Flow:</strong> Players offer up to two cards face-down for the next player to pick; if that player doesn\u2019t trust them, they can request a third card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>Pairing:</strong> Whenever you collect a pair, discard it immediately.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>Objective:</strong> Discard your hand as quickly as possible, while avoiding the Dog Card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>Loss condition:</strong> At round\u2019s end, whoever is stuck with the Dog Card is eliminated. Rounds repeat with remaining players until one survivor remains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802520?t=1749615869","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802520/ce80b9ebb90e7d1c1a70fb4409505bc7884f8c94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749615869","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802520/8688945f00e0b01500ed532f06d9ae903aeee877/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749615869","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802520/8688945f00e0b01500ed532f06d9ae903aeee877/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749615869","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802520/extras/logo.png?t=1749615869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the \u201c<strong>Old Dog</strong>\u201d mode against Bot players and get a taste of the horror-card game style; bluff, swap, and outsmart to avoid the dreaded Dog Card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802520/extras/Screenshot_202